# Secrets NEVER enter an image layer. This repo has already leaked a .env
# once (see .gitignore) - an image is even easier to push somewhere public.
.env
.env.*
!.env.dist
.git
.venv/
venv/
AI/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
# Caches and state are bind-mounted at run time (deploy/docker-compose.yml), and
# the codex DB rebuilds in ~0.3s - none of it belongs in an image. The Q&A
# crawl is 6.7MB the running bot never reads (only scrapers/orna_scrape_qa.py).
data/cache/
data/state/
data/qa_crawl/
